<h3 id="%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">💡 Key Findings &amp; HR Insights:<a class="anchor-link" href="#%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">¶</a></h3><ul>
<li>Overtime Danger: Employees working Overtime have a massive attrition rate of 30.5%, compared to only 10.4% for those with standard working hours.</li>
<li>The Attrition Multiplier: Requiring employees to work overtime nearly triples their likelihood of resigning from the company.</li>
<li>HR Recommendation: Address burnout immediately. Limit continuous overtime, distribute workloads evenly, or introduce compensation restructuring for high-overtime roles.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
