<h1 id="%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">💡 Key Findings &amp; HR Insights:<a class="anchor-link" href="#%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">¶</a></h1><ul>
<li>Younger Attrition: Attrition heavily spikes among younger employees, specifically between the ages of 25 and 31.</li>
<li>Senior Stability: Older employees (above 40) show very high stability and rarely leave the company.</li>
<li>HR Recommendation: Focus on engagement and clear career growth plans for young hires to decrease early-stage turnover.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
