<h3 id="%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">💡 Key Findings &amp; HR Insights:<a class="anchor-link" href="#%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">¶</a></h3><ul>
<li><p>Income Disparity: Employees who left earned a lower average monthly income of 4787 dollars compared to those who stayed at 6832 dollars.</p>
</li>
<li><p>The Low Salary Risk: Attrition is heavily concentrated among employees earning less than 5000 dollars per month.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Retention at Higher Salaries: Once the monthly income exceeds 10000 dollars, the employee turnover drops significantly.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
