<h3 id="%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">💡 Key Findings &amp; HR Insights:<a class="anchor-link" href="#%F0%9F%92%A1-Key-Findings-&amp;-HR-Insights:">¶</a></h3><ul>
<li><p>The Burnout Danger Zone: Employees with poor work-life balance (Level 1) have a critical attrition rate of over 31%, making it one of the highest drivers of turnover in the company.</p>
</li>
<li><p>The Sweet Spot: Attrition drops dramatically to around 14%-17% for employees who achieve moderate to good balance (Levels 2, 3 &amp; 4).</p>
</li>
<li><p>HR Recommendation: Implement flexible working hours or remote/hybrid options for departments suffering from high attrition to improve their work-life scores and prevent talent burnout.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
