<h1 id="%F0%9F%94%B4Key-Problems-Identified:">🔴Key Problems Identified:<a class="anchor-link" href="#%F0%9F%94%B4Key-Problems-Identified:">¶</a></h1><h2 id="1.High-Employee-Attrition-Rate-(16.1%25)">1.High Employee Attrition Rate (16.1%)<a class="anchor-link" href="#1.High-Employee-Attrition-Rate-(16.1%25)">¶</a></h2><h2 id="A-noticeable-percentage-of-employees-are-leaving-the-company.">A noticeable percentage of employees are leaving the company.<a class="anchor-link" href="#A-noticeable-percentage-of-employees-are-leaving-the-company.">¶</a></h2><h2 id="2.Sales-Department-has-the-Highest-Turnovers">2.Sales Department has the Highest Turnovers<a class="anchor-link" href="#2.Sales-Department-has-the-Highest-Turnovers">¶</a></h2><h2 id="Employees-in-Sales-are-leaving-more-than-other-departments.">Employees in Sales are leaving more than other departments.<a class="anchor-link" href="#Employees-in-Sales-are-leaving-more-than-other-departments.">¶</a></h2><h2 id="3.Sales-Representative-Role-is-the-Most-Affected">3.Sales Representative Role is the Most Affected<a class="anchor-link" href="#3.Sales-Representative-Role-is-the-Most-Affected">¶</a></h2><h2 id="Nearly-40%25-attrition-rate-in-this-job-role.">Nearly 40% attrition rate in this job role.<a class="anchor-link" href="#Nearly-40%25-attrition-rate-in-this-job-role.">¶</a></h2><h2 id="4.Overtime-significantly-increases-attrition">4.Overtime significantly increases attrition<a class="anchor-link" href="#4.Overtime-significantly-increases-attrition">¶</a></h2><h2 id="Employees-working-overtime-are-much-more-likely-to-resign.">Employees working overtime are much more likely to resign.<a class="anchor-link" href="#Employees-working-overtime-are-much-more-likely-to-resign.">¶</a></h2><h2 id="5.-Younger-Employees-are-Leaving-More">5. Younger Employees are Leaving More<a class="anchor-link" href="#5.-Younger-Employees-are-Leaving-More">¶</a></h2><h2 id="Attrition-is-higher-among-younger-age-groups-compared-to-older-employees.">Attrition is higher among younger age groups compared to older employees.<a class="anchor-link" href="#Attrition-is-higher-among-younger-age-groups-compared-to-older-employees.">¶</a></h2>
